│                          │ - The long-range CZs encourage global mixing across the 8-qubit register, which is useful │
│                          │ because the feature map already injects pairwise correlations through IsingZZ couplings.  │
│                          │ - The result should preserve accuracy while reducing train-test gap and converging more   │
│                          │ cleanly in the repeated re-uploading pipeline.                                            │
